#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニタ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Đây là một trong những chiếc màn hình mà Monokuma hay xuất hiện.\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>いまは校章が浮かんでいるだけだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Right now, it's just showing the school crest.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラ…
#. きっと今も、この向こうで黒幕が…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Even now...on the other side of this camera, the\n"
"mastermind...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、それももうすぐ終わりだ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But that's gonna come to an end soon enough!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>時は金なり。
#. つまり、人生とは貯金を使い果たすもの。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Time is money, they say. Which means I'm burning\n"
"through my life savings just by existing...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0006 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Có"

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0007 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr "Không"

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Rời khỏi đây?\n"
"<CLT>"
